{"name":"Before the Storm","hex":"#4d6a77","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"before","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Preposition","definitions":["Earlier than (in time).","In front of in space."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["At an earlier time.","In advance in position or sequence; ahead."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/before"},{"term":"storm","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any disturbed state of the atmosphere causing destructive or unpleasant weather, especially one affecting the earth's surface involving strong winds (leading to high waves at sea) and usually lightning, thunder, and precipitation.","A heavy fall of precipitation (hail, rain, or snow) or bout of lightning and thunder without strong winds; a hail storm, rainstorm, snowstorm, or thunderstorm."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Preceded by the dummy subject it: to have strong winds and usually lightning and thunder, and/or hail, rain, or snow.","To make (someone or something) stormy; to agitate (someone or something) violently.\n\n\nTo disturb or trouble (someone)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/storm"}],"entries":[{"title":"Before the Storm (2000 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Before the Storm is a drama crime thriller film directed by Reza Parsa released in 2000."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/ac/Before_the_Storm_2000.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Before_the_Storm_(2000_film)"},{"title":"Ill Wind (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Ill Wind is a 2007 French film written and directed by Stéphane Allagnon. Sent to repair the computers at a supermarket in a town hit by a storm, a technician discovers some unusual things and is faced with difficult decisions."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/14/Vent-mauvais.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ill_Wind_(film)"},{"title":"Before the Storm (Darude album)","blocks":[{"text":"Before the Storm is the debut studio album by Finnish DJ and record producer Darude. It was released on 18 September 2000 by 16 Inch Records. The album sold 800,000 copies worldwide. It also peaked number one on the Finland's Official List for albums."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/7a/Darude_Before_the_Storm.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Before_the_Storm_(Darude_album)"},{"title":"Storm","blocks":[{"text":"A storm is any disturbed state of the natural environment or the atmosphere of an astronomical body. It may be marked by significant disruptions to normal conditions such as strong wind, tornadoes, hail, thunder and lightning, heavy precipitation, heavy freezing rain, strong winds, wind transporting some substance through the atmosphere such as in a dust storm, among other forms of severe weather."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Cloud_cumulonimbus_at_baltic_sea%281%29.jpg/330px-Cloud_cumulonimbus_at_baltic_sea%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Storm"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/29/Darude-Before_the_Storm.jpg/250px-Darude-Before_the_Storm.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/29/Darude-Before_the_Storm.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/29/Darude-Before_the_Storm.jpg/250px-Darude-Before_the_Storm.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADarude-Before_the_Storm.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/t